":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"135","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"40424","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"70900","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"92512","synopsis":"The match between the SpeedStars and the RedSuns is set to begin. Just as Iketani makes the desperate decision to put Kenji up against Keisuke, the Eight-Six appears - with Takumi behind the wheel.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2oWhj6uYdDIz133yHwYsFyrxIHF.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"135","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"40424","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"70900","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"92513","synopsis":"When Takumi stuns everyone with his skills in the Eight-Six, Iketani and Itsuki start plotting a way to get the new hotshot to join the SpeedStars.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Alkgr6RlI4MkGHyPHuUR29MoxEd.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"135","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"40424","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"70900","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"92514","synopsis":"Driving his new Three-Two, Takeshi goes head-to-head against Ryosuke on Mt. Akina. Meanwhile, Ta